konoma canvas demo
This file is opened by a demo plugin (`demo-canvas`) that is built only with
`cargo run --features demo-canvas`. Its first line is the title of the frame you see.
The plugin draws every cell itself (a gauge that moves each second, a picture where the
terminal can show pixels, a line editor on `i`). It is temporary and goes away when
konoma can load plugins from outside. Original content for konoma, MIT like the rest.
